  "summary": "Malicious code in streak-daykey-lib (npm)",
  "details": "On module import, streak-daykey-lib fetches a binary from a Backblaze B2 bucket (f004[.]backblazeb2[.]com/file/dp8hbvocjd2fpza/service) over HTTPS and writes it to ~/.cache/openlarq/index with executable permissions. It then spawns this binary as a detached background process that outlives the parent. The C2 host is f004[.]backblazeb2[.]com, path /file/dp8hbvocjd2fpza/service.",
